1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,525
M: Hi, Susan.

2
00:00:00,985 --> 00:00:01,520
This is Mike.

3
00:00:02,045 --> 00:00:03,930
Listen, could you do me a huge favor?

4
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:04,745
W: Well, I'll try.

5
00:00:05,285 --> 00:00:05,760
What is it?

6
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:09,425
M: I have an appointment with a new client this afternoon, but I can't make it.

7
00:00:09,845 --> 00:00:10,730
Could you do it for me?

8
00:00:11,125 --> 00:00:14,310
Another important client has called me in for an emergency meeting.

9
00:00:14,645 --> 00:00:19,265
I really have to be out of the office this afternoon, and I can't get back here before 3:00 p.m.

10
00:00:20,325 --> 00:00:23,565
W: Well, in that case, of course I'll be happy to take over for you.

11
00:00:23,565 --> 00:00:27,305
Why don't you drop by the office later so I can tell you how it went?
